[stderr] | ADJ-18 | Typed, C=`Jürgen Klopp`, aliases={`klopp`} | `Jurgen Klop` | rejected / `unconfigured_variant` |
[stderr] | ADJ-19 | Typed, C=`Paris Saint-Germain`, aliases={`psg`} | `P.S.G.` | accepted / `normalised_alias_match` |
