[stderr] 
[stderr] Whitespace-only typed input is `normalises_empty`. ADJ-20 is a failed
[stderr] validation configuration, not releasable content: ambiguity is surfaced, never
[stderr] guessed. An answer against `QB-A-28@r1` uses r1 values, never corrected r2.
