[stderr] | `LIFE-FX-11` | Resolve and continue cards 1–9 of LIFE-FX-01, then resolve and continue card 10. | Each of the first nine continuations traverses `feedback(card n) → active(card n+1)` after a safe save; the tenth traverses `feedback(last) → results` once. |
